Data Warehousing 
BILL INMON is the father of data warehouse.



Subject oriented - That means that the warehouse is always focused on a business area like sales,customers, finance and so on .
Integrated - means it goes and integrates multiple source systems usually you build a warehouse not only for one source but for multiple sources.

Time variant - You can keep the historical data inside data warehouse .

Non volatile - Once the data enter data warehouse it is not deleted or modified .

